  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Data Mining and Early Warning for Animal Health Threats</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objectives of this project are to provide innovative and user-friendly Early Warning tools with capability to perform data mining and analyses for early detection and effective response to animal health threats, for use at the national and global levels. The project will support target countries in enhancing veterinary services capacities with the use of innovative tools for EW and in developing policies to ensure the sustainability of an effective and sustainable EWS. 
The project will empower countries with strategies and tools to improve the collection, collation, integration and analysis of data. This will enable the transformation of those data into actionable information for decision-making in health surveillance, at national and global level.</narrative>
  </description>
